nce wire rules still require whole fact references within nested typed records, so DH15's abbreviated enumeration does not discharge the existing I2 recursive-wire repair. DI21's “every refusal” wording is scoped by declared settles and the explicit capability/platform reservation exceptions; qualify its wording. Applied unchanged state/party/ref/value/hold records retain the four difference-only cases and deterministic replay witness 18.33. Attention/create platform rows retain their proposed/owned/open distinctions. Clarify stale filing/status prose, including the obsolete “neither filed” sentence. Current adopted R3 revision 16 at 7bc60cf6 (d6e7e878) and adopted C2 revision 4 at 16777d97 (2621bc2f) replace frozen sibling status labels and retain the normal input-reading duty; neither closes source implementation debt.\n\nEvidence ledger: /tmp/artroom-checker-n4-r1-7ef-ordinary-ledger.json, 104,220 bytes, SHA256 3128b31dc30792b2c55b6857f2cf6d20b43607dd2ee5b82b22783a0f48d80d89. Static review only. No tests, builds, installs, typecheck, project imports/scripts, private diagnostics, provider operations, source edits or process launches; the six private cloud-review script bodies remain unopened. Producer controls/timings remain attributed and establish no 10x or real operational acceptance.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:5c949edbaaba655dfab9dadeca468624d74fb25b","binding":"evidence-only","head":"7efb0f7f0fe601b7280adf4d68d0bc011233443b","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:24672160382a6375a03cfa66d34e2824fb921a53\",\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:80279ef0c165a324cc69e41d1a4597907ace6dff\",\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:709c3f7afe7eb4c55cadcf8ffb1bd819974e1847\",\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:78c1094864350ce48af7e8ce834c9ef803399b9c\",\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7a